# Audit log

When you diagnose or fix a VPSops dash bug, **append a dated entry** to [docs/AUDIT.md](docs/AUDIT.md) before you finish. Read that file first if the work touches an area already listed there.

Entry shape: **Symptom**, **Cause**, **Fix**, **Do not**, **Tests**. Newest first under the intro.

Do not reintroduce a listed fix. Do not skip the log because the code comment feels enough.